Apply the exact gate to QualityHypothesis: Causal claims remain provisional until supported by discriminating evidence. Pass only when all decisive field relations are supported by current authorized evidence. Fail for a concrete contradiction or violated invariant. Needs-review when decisive evidence or authority is missing or unresolved.
